  "hints": [
    "LIFT-POWER costs 35 but the generator only supplies 30. A lit wing holds an energy cell that raises the limit.",
    "Light the side rooms with WING-LAMP, walk west to the cell, return to the console, then swap: WING-LAMP off, ROUTE-LIGHTS and LIFT-POWER on (50 of 50). Save an empty recording, launch, and follow the corridor east."
  ],
  "terminals": [
