      "lines": [
        "The generator can only feed so much at once.",
        "Every switch is a small choice about what to leave in the dark."
      ]
    },
    {
      "position": [
        4,
        4
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Day 4. I thank the console when it works.",
        "The screen glows a little brighter. I know that is silly."
      ]
    },
